          %h3#cordiers_homotopy_coherent_nerve Cordier’s Homotopy coherent nerve
          .un_theorem
            %h6#theorem Theorem
            %p
              %strong Cordier (1980)
            %p
              For each a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/small+category"} small category
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
